        "text": "**Fetching Secret Version**\n\nI'm currently focused on the `rotate_secret_version.py` file and its task of retrieving a specific secret version, or staged value, from Azure Key Vault. I'm noting that Azure Key Vault utilizes versions instead of explicit \"staged values\" like some other services. My task is to retrieve one.\n\n\n**Retrieving Secret Details**\n\nI'm now fully immersed in the functionality of `rotate_secret_version.py`. This script zeroes in on fetching a particular secret version from Azure Key Vault, using the `version_id` if one is specified. I'm carefully navigating the nuanced approach Azure takes with versions, instead of explicit staging.\n\n\n",
