      "data": {
        "text": "**Analyzing Rotation Status**\n\nI'm working on `rotation_summary.py` to deduce secret rotation status, as Azure Key Vault lacks a direct \"rotation status\" field. I'm focusing on the `created_on` and `updated_on` properties to simulate this, considering their relationship to determine if a secret has been actively rotated.\n\n\n**Inferring Rotation Status**\n\nI'm now diving deeper into `get_properties_of_secrets`. My strategy for inferring rotation is solidifying: analyzing the `created_on` and `updated_on` timestamps is the core, complemented by potential tag examination. I'm focusing on the secrets metadata from Azure Key Vault to get the necessary data. I'm not using the Rotation Policy API, as it doesn't exist.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
